    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d261">

                <pb facs="0560" n="532" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v23p2/pg532"/>

                <head>261. Memorandum From the Deputy Secretary of Defense (Quarles) to the
                    Secretary of the Army (Brucker)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d261-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1957-12-24"><hi rendition="#italic">December 24,
                        1957</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Introduction into Korea of the Honest John and 280mm Gun, [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">1 line of source text not declassified</hi>] (Top
                        Secret)</item>
                </list>
                <p>You hereby are authorized, in implementation of State–Defense cables (1) To Seoul
                    229, dtd Sept 16, 1957;<anchor n="2" xml:id="d261-f2"/> (2) DEF 933850, dtd Dec
                        <pb facs="0561" n="533" xml:id="pg533"/> 11, 1957;<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d261-f3"/> (3) DEF 933889, dtd Dec 11, 1957,<anchor n="4"
                        xml:id="d261-f4"/> to introduce into Korea the Honest John and 280mm gun,
                        [<hi rendition="#italic">less than 1 line of source text not
                        declassified</hi>] as soon as is feasible under Army deployment
                    schedules.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Donald A. Quarles</hi><anchor n="5"
                            xml:id="d261-f5"/></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
